                    coach_intro:            `In agri-food the brand is a promise about the supply chain, and its credibility lives in verified, farm-level proof. Commit and verify the supply chain before — and as a bound on — what the brand claims. Protect the €242M Nordmilk volume and the rich margin behind it, build an ingredient brand that reduces your buyer's risk, differentiate on what you can prove farm by farm, and never model only the optimistic top of the premium range.`,

